{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"锥 (拓扑学)"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"锥(拓扑学)"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑学"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑空间"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 的<strong>锥</strong> (cone) 是\n$$\r\nCX := \\frac{X\\times [0,1]}{X\\times \\{0\\}}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>注意, 当 $X = \\varnothing$ 时, $CX = {*}$ 为单点. 因为\n$\nC\\varnothing = \\operatorname{colim}\n(\n{* \\leftarrow \\varnothing \\to \\varnothing}\n) = *.\n$</p>\n<h3>作为分层空间</h3>\n<p>若 $X\\to P$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"分层","text":"分层空间"}},{"Plain":", 则 $X$ 上的锥带有分层:\n$$\r\n\\frac{X\\times [0,1]}{X\\times \\{0\\}}\\to P^{\\triangleleft},\r\n$$\n其中 $P^{\\triangleleft}$ 是偏序集 $P$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"锥(范畴论)","text":"锥"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>奇点</h3>\n<p>所谓 “带奇点的流形”, 往往奇点附近的形状是某个流形的锥.</p>\n<p>相关页面:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"cob-sing","text":"带奇点配边假设"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Milnor纤维化","text":"Milnor 纤维化"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}